   bpftool prog load block-port-prog /sys/fs/bpf/block-port-prog type lsm secid 0 /sys/fs/bpf/
   ```
3. **Attach** the program to the LSM hook:
   ```bash
   sudo bpftool prog attach lsm security /sys/fs/bpf/block-port-prog type lsm secid 0 /sys/fs/bpf/
   ```
